                        "cartridges with a standard: 17  (3.3%)\n",
                        "\n",
                        ">> Most cartridges have NO standard on them. Per-cartridge\n",
                        "   calibration is not possible for the bulk of the data. Options,\n",
                        "   in order of how defensible they are:\n",
                        "     a) calibrate only the subset of cartridges that do have one\n",
                        "     b) treat run_date as the batch variable and model it\n",
                        "     c) look for unlabelled standards (candidates listed below)\n",
                        "\n",
                        "standard signal by year (geomean across all genes):\n",
                        "       n   median   cv\n",
                        "year                  \n",
                        "2015  36   796.20 1.42\n",
