                        "2023  12 1,392.58 0.27\n",
                        "\n",
                        "overall CV across all standards: 149.3%\n",
                        "largest step change: 2023 (63 standards before, 12 after), level 2.62x, separation t=4.3\n",
                        ">> That is a step, not drift. Most likely a new reference lot\n",
                        "   or a protocol change. Set ERA_BREAKS = ['2023-01-01'] in\n",
                        "   Cell 15 so factors are computed within each era separately.\n",
                        "   Calibrating across a step injects a fake batch effect.\n",
                        "\n",
