                        "    Sample06     16          16              False        140\n",
                        "    Sample05     16          16              False        140\n",
                        "          02     20           8              False       3877\n",
                        ">> Check these. Any that are really the same pooled RNA should be\n",
                        "   added to STANDARD_PAT in Cell 2 and the pipeline re-run.\n",
