                        "17 cartridges x 76 genes\n",
                        "\n",
                        "cartridges furthest from the reference:\n",
                        "              median_factor  min_factor  max_factor\n",
                        "cartridge                                          \n",
                        "SP-20230211b           0.59        0.07        5.20\n",
                        "qz092415               0.59        0.01        2.85\n",
                        "SP-20230125b           0.61        0.03        3.12\n",
                        "SP-20230209a           0.76        0.02        3.42\n",
                        "040815AT               0.83        0.03        6.60\n",
                        "AT                     1.41        0.01        6.32\n",
                        "062515LNAT             1.47        0.02        6.84\n",
                        "SP-20220413            1.55        0.27       19.23\n",
                        "SP-20220624            1.67        0.28       52.75\n",
                        "ATele                  4.08        0.02       17.67\n",
                        "\n",
                        ">> 1 cartridges are off by more than 2x. Investigate\n",
                        "   these before applying anything - a failed standard lane will\n",
                        "   otherwise drag every patient sample on that cartridge with it.\n",
